Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Conditional kappa 0.001591968902833346: exactly retimed
 static44 complex supplier with R420 bit

Adds research/exact-retimed-static44. An exact per-component 0/1 program
over all monotone frame lifts (PR534's interface) of PR544's static44
complex word lifts 416 gate frames; the complex supplier rises to
b = 1594507308884431019637/10^24. Composed with PR543's R420 bit
(c = 0.001653826988146799) through PR543/PR510's own assemble9.py,
kappa = 795984451416673/(5*10^17), complex-bound. The verifier runs the
PR544 and PR543 verifiers unmodified, applies the frozen lift map, reruns
the full PR531/PR544 local and global complex pipeline on the changed
word, prices it with two exact engines and checks four new negative
controls. Conditional on all inherited supplier contracts and on PR543's
open phase-B interface question.

